*.py[cod]

# Editor / OS cruft
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Local harness state
.claude/
**/codex-help.md

# Soak-test build outputs (isolated from target/ so a live bot restart cannot
# pick up unapproved binaries)
target-soak/
**/target-soak/
